    <briefdescription>
<para>This structure contains the parameters for atomically building an AEPI image in ASUFW. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The caller supplies a plaintext provisioning-instruction stream and an output buffer. ASUFW resolves the requesting subsystem&apos;s provisioning wrapping public key and authentication private key internally, encrypts the chunk chain and signs the header. </para>    </detaileddescription>
